<title>USA: McHenry, Ill., $3.600 mln won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>McHenry, Ill., $3.600 mln won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $3.600 million of McHenry, Ill., general obligation sales tax alternate revenue source, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
